      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8875034::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to equiatomic CoCrFeMnNi, the Co-free alloy will exhibit a significantly larger twin-boundary fraction at lower temperature and lower strain rate.",
